@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Safehome Security Function

[*] --> PowerOnCheck

state "Power On Check" as PowerOnCheck
state "Stopped" as Stopped
state "Ready To Use" as ReadyToUse
state "Monitoring" as Monitoring
state "Alarm Activated" as AlarmActivated
state "Normal Operation" as NormalOperation

PowerOnCheck --> Stopped : [Problem]
PowerOnCheck --> ReadyToUse : [Everything Fine]

Stopped --> ReadyToUse : Reset
Stopped --> ReadyToUse : Activate
Stopped --> ReadyToUse : Turn Off

ReadyToUse --> Monitoring : Activate
ReadyToUse --> NormalOperation : Enter Password

Monitoring --> AlarmActivated : Sensor Triggered
AlarmActivated --> NormalOperation : False Alarm / Time Ends

NormalOperation --> Stopped : Enter Password

@enduml
